{"2888220": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "<FAIL.safe>", "steam_appid": 2888220, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&lt;FAIL.safe&gt;</strong> is a groundbreaking <strong>narrative adventure game</strong> that redefines player choice and immersion within the genre.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enter the Mindspace</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888220/extras/e3e988a06e679389047e46a2cb634ee5.poster.avif?t=1767733135\" width=608 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888220/extras/e3e988a06e679389047e46a2cb634ee5.webm?t=1767733135\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888220/extras/e3e988a06e679389047e46a2cb634ee5.mp4?t=1767733135\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Changing the game of Dialogue</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through the innovative &quot;Mindspace&quot; feature, you will forge and navigate a relationship with Novah, the wary AI aboard the Destin, engaging in deep, dynamic conversations. Leave behind the limitations of traditional three-option dialogue systems and embrace a level of expression in your interactions unlike anything you have ever seen before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888220/extras/8b980c889c10a357fc527c0d728bd384.poster.avif?t=1767733135\" width=608 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888220/extras/8b980c889c10a357fc527c0d728bd384.webm?t=1767733135\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888220/extras/8b980c889c10a357fc527c0d728bd384.mp4?t=1767733135\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Conversation Crafting</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are pushing the boundaries of NPC interface and interaction to lead the industry into the future. Our innovative Conversation Crafting system (The Mindspace) allows you the agency to create and navigate a deep relationship with an NPC like you never have before. <strong>This will push you to play in a way like you never have before.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888220/extras/335fbe2422a22b3337c492ccb749e897.poster.avif?t=1767733135\" width=608 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888220/extras/335fbe2422a22b3337c492ccb749e897.webm?t=1767733135\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888220/extras/335fbe2422a22b3337c492ccb749e897.mp4?t=1767733135\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Destin</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are stuck on The Destin, a forsaken starship on the brink of oblivion that is controlled by Novah, a sentient AI who holds the key to your survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888220/extras/ec26391c7902d91a9901aa5f2628bf79.poster.avif?t=1767733135\" width=608 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888220/extras/ec26391c7902d91a9901aa5f2628bf79.webm?t=1767733135\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888220/extras/ec26391c7902d91a9901aa5f2628bf79.mp4?t=1767733135\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Choice is Yours</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Befriend, manipulate, deceive, and persuade your way to freedom by solving puzzles, unraveling the story, and trying to survive in this sci-fi narrative adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888220/extras/1978e7cdfb76c86dbd50adb3863a0cce.poster.avif?t=1767733135\" width=608 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888220/extras/1978e7cdfb76c86dbd50adb3863a0cce.webm?t=1767733135\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888220/extras/1978e7cdfb76c86dbd50adb3863a0cce.mp4?t=1767733135\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&lt;FAIL.safe&gt;</strong> is a groundbreaking <strong>narrative adventure game</strong> that redefines player choice and immersion within the genre.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enter the Mindspace</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888220/extras/e3e988a06e679389047e46a2cb634ee5.poster.avif?t=1767733135\" width=608 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888220/extras/e3e988a06e679389047e46a2cb634ee5.webm?t=1767733135\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888220/extras/e3e988a06e679389047e46a2cb634ee5.mp4?t=1767733135\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Changing the game of Dialogue</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through the innovative &quot;Mindspace&quot; feature, you will forge and navigate a relationship with Novah, the wary AI aboard the Destin, engaging in deep, dynamic conversations. Leave behind the limitations of traditional three-option dialogue systems and embrace a level of expression in your interactions unlike anything you have ever seen before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888220/extras/8b980c889c10a357fc527c0d728bd384.poster.avif?t=1767733135\" width=608 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888220/extras/8b980c889c10a357fc527c0d728bd384.webm?t=1767733135\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888220/extras/8b980c889c10a357fc527c0d728bd384.mp4?t=1767733135\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Conversation Crafting</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are pushing the boundaries of NPC interface and interaction to lead the industry into the future. Our innovative Conversation Crafting system (The Mindspace) allows you the agency to create and navigate a deep relationship with an NPC like you never have before. <strong>This will push you to play in a way like you never have before.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888220/extras/335fbe2422a22b3337c492ccb749e897.poster.avif?t=1767733135\" width=608 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888220/extras/335fbe2422a22b3337c492ccb74